		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>When I first met Drolma. her name was Shirin. She was living at the New York Khanaqah, and she was an astrologer. I remember astrological conversation with her, as well as a mutual focus on light.<br />
     I remember her beautiful wedding at the Abode,<br />
The last time I saw her was a most coincidental meeting, at a Festival somewhere in California, where she was marketing windows. I remember thinking that that was also something to do with light&#8230;.</p>
